dsh-telegram README · Path B — manual profile wiring：Used by this deployment, and handy when you want to hack on the source in place.

1. Make the profile depend on the directory (a symlink install, so edits are live after a
   harness restart):

```jsonc
   // ~/.dsh/profiles/<profile>/package.json
   {
     "dependencies": {
       "dsh-telegram": "link:/abs/path/to/dsh-paean-telegram"

dsh-telegram README · Configuration：Minimal working file:

```json
{
  "security": { "allowedChatIds": [123456789] },
  "watch": { "autoStart": true }
}
